+      <dl newline="true" spacing="normal" indent="3" pn="section-appendix.c-4">
+        <dt pn="section-appendix.c-4.1">Key size limit</dt>
+        <dd pn="section-appendix.c-4.2">The key size limit gives the size of the largest public key that
+can be legally used for encryption in cipher suites that are
+exportable.</dd>
